[{"id":182198893,"discussion_id":"8d244143118a6ef1347109927444a8df045fc1bd","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `wqbmm` 内核在 28 核场景下的精度问题。问题根源在于 N 维度分块调度时，`n0Stop` 会包含为 NZ 量化格式尾部对齐而引入的填充区域，但原有代码未区分这些填充列与实际有效列，导致对填充区域进行了错误的计算。修复方式是在 `kernel_matmul_a_prefetch_b_antiquant.h` 的两处主循环中，引入 `nSize`（真实 N 维度大小）作为边界检查：在遍历 `n0` 分块时提前跳出超出 `nSize` 的迭代，并将 `tileN` 动态计算为 `Min(nSize - coordN, blockScheduler.n0Tile)`，同时对 `n1`/`n2` 循环中 `tileN` 的声明方式进行了局部化修正。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **N 维度边界提前退出**：在两处主循环的 `n0` 分块遍历中新增 `if (coordN >= nSize) { break; }` 检查，防止处理超出实际 N 维度范围的填充列。\n- **`tileN` 动态裁剪**：在 `n0` 分块中将原先固定的 `tileN = blockScheduler.n0Tile` 改为 `auto tileN = Min(nSize - coordN, blockScheduler.n0Tile)`，确保末尾分块不会超出真实 N 边界。\n- **`tileN` 变量作用域修正**：将 `n1` 和 `n2` 循环中复用的外部 `tileN` 变量改为各自循环内独立声明的 `auto tileN`，避免跨分块区域的状态污染。\n- **引入 `nSize` 获取真实问题维度**：在两处主循环开头添加 `auto nSize = Get<1>(params.problemShape)`，为后续边界检查提供真实的 N 维度大小。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T11:41:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-29T12:12:30+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":182198894,"discussion_id":"151a0d23787167a3aaa33bf8d9fa40f1761b68fe","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T11:41:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-29T12:39:24+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":182198929,"discussion_id":"e12feac7327c626f2053811e08b264fb8107051f","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can b